{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-119","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816550-line","text":"你身处一片破碎的忆泡中，一琥珀纪一度的千星跳蚤市场正进入最热闹的阶段。在这里，不再需要投影货架和信用点，只要有相中的物品，都能够用以物易物来交换。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816551-line","text":"铺天盖地的航船还未泊停便已易主，向来清修的布雷塔德人，也忙不迭地在身上寻找可以交换的商品。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816552-line","text":"你遇见一位胡子拉碴的吟游诗人，他为你展示古老的布袋，盛满了银河的记忆。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816553-line","text":"「故事，请为我讲述一个故事，真假皆可。」诗人说，「然后，我带走你的诗句，你拿走我的歌声。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-1869401699070440945-choice","text":"讲述多彩的旅途。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-11305856290418073952-effect","text":"提交祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-14104017414082285654-choice","text":"雪原的赏金猎人。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-6132995357496605747-choice","text":"图书馆的虚构史学家。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-8392135967272805539-choice","text":"讲述惊奇的冒险。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-14507658815805546499-effect","text":"提交奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-11885915246953576131-choice","text":"下厨的王下一桶。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-13794169222018938135-choice","text":"计算机的猜拳游戏。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-3892576449541471713-choice","text":"讲述朴实的生活。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-3576702563600281130-effect","text":"提交宇宙碎片。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-text-18288326102997898319-choice","text":"昨晚的梦。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816555-line","text":"诗人微微阖眼，你沉没在一片寂静的海洋。音符是它的水滴，歌声是它的流向，故事沿着水流浸入你的胸膛。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-119-talk-403816556-line","text":"你看见万年不息的舞蹈，伶人们在贡多拉哭泣，钻石雨从天幕落下。当喧嚣重新回到你的世界，吟游诗人已不见踪影。正如他所言，带走了你的诗句。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
